<version>1.0.0</version>
<language>Rust</language>
Output src/simplicial.rs. std only. SimplicialComplex::from_facets (all faces, sorted vertex lists, index maps); chain_complex with alternating signs; coboundary of integer cochains; Alexander-Whitney cup (a cup b)[v0..v_{p+q}] = a[v0..vp] b[vp..v_{p+q}]; cohomology_basis_mod_p (kernel of delta completed modulo image of delta). TorusTriangulation::new(sides >= 3): Freudenthal triangulation (each unit cube into d! simplices along permutations), top simplices with orientation sign (path order vs sorted order times sign of the permutation), seam_cocycle(dir) counting crossings of the periodic seam, evaluate_top on the fundamental cycle. Tests: S^2, RP^2, Klein bottle, torus homology; cup products mod 2 (RP^2: w^2 != 0; T^2: ab != 0, a^2 = b^2 = 0); tests/thooft.rs: int n cup n = 2 Pf(n) on T^4.
